and he can tell only me.

278
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:37,940
Go.

279
00:15:38,390 --> 00:15:39,360
I'll go with you.

280
00:15:39,700 --> 00:15:41,360
Let's see what they want to do.

281
00:15:43,520 --> 00:15:45,490
Han Pinmu also sent me a message.

282
00:15:43,620 --> 00:15:44,390
[Sender: Han Pinmu]

283
00:15:44,420 --> 00:15:45,590
[Come to the internet cafe at 11 p.m.]

284
00:15:45,610 --> 00:15:47,030
[I need your help
with something important.]

285
00:15:45,980 --> 00:15:47,250
He asked me to meet him

286
00:15:47,250 --> 00:15:48,550
at the internet cafe at 11:00 p.m.

287
00:15:48,550 --> 00:15:51,480
He said he has something important
and needs my help.

288
00:15:51,710 --> 00:15:53,250
What are these two up to?

289
00:15:53,610 --> 00:15:54,610
Go to that one too.

290
00:15:55,130 --> 00:15:56,340
At this critical moment,

291
00:15:56,340 --> 00:15:58,150
I'm not afraid of them making trouble.

292
00:15:58,150 --> 00:15:59,980
I'm more afraid of them staying quiet

293
00:15:59,980 --> 00:16:01,040
and doing nothing.

294
00:16:02,740 --> 00:16:05,610
[Xihai City Long-Distance Bus Station]

295
00:16:14,550 --> 00:16:16,750
Wake up. We've arrived. Time to get off.

296
00:16:25,880 --> 00:16:27,160
Hey, wake up.

297
00:16:27,410 --> 00:16:29,070
We're at the station. Get off.

298
00:16:36,050 --> 00:16:37,170
Why do you keep nagging me

299
00:16:37,170 --> 00:16:38,570
about such a small thing?

300
00:16:38,700 --> 00:16:40,120
Alright, I'll pay the electricity bill.

301
00:16:40,120 --> 00:16:41,130
Happy now?

302
00:16:41,570 --> 00:16:42,710
Alright, I got it.

303
00:16:49,980 --> 00:16:50,700
Master.

304
00:16:52,930 --> 00:16:54,870
I want to leave early today.

305
00:16:55,170 --> 00:16:56,130
Working overtime every day

306
00:16:56,130 --> 00:16:57,670
is too much for my family.

307
00:16:57,890 --> 00:16:59,030
The master stays

308
00:16:59,030 --> 00:17:00,240
and the apprentice leaves?

309
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:02,290
Did you take bribes from Zhao Ganzhe

310
00:17:02,290 --> 00:17:03,740
to betray us?

311
00:17:03,840 --> 00:17:06,109
No, I wouldn't dare get involved
in whatever is going on

312
00:17:06,109 --> 00:17:07,750
between you and Captain Zhao.

313
00:17:07,750 --> 00:17:10,440
Aren't you and Xu Ling on duty today?

314
00:17:10,500 --> 00:17:12,420
Captain Fan, I swapped with Sen.

315
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:15,460
Alright, alright. Go get some rest.

316
00:17:15,460 --> 00:17:15,980
Go, go.

317
00:17:15,980 --> 00:17:17,700
Okay, thank you, Master.

318
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:22,450
[Liu Xiaohua]
[Robbery; Rape]

319
00:17:22,450 --> 00:17:24,310
[Chen Chunli] [Li Zhengbin]
[Zhang Chengguo]

320
00:17:32,970 --> 00:17:34,430
Hello, this is Fanjie.

321
00:17:39,190 --> 00:17:39,860
Okay.

322
00:17:40,540 --> 00:17:41,670
I'll be right there.

323
00:17:42,020 --> 00:17:43,130
Wang Tao! Xu Ling!

324
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:43,910
Here.

325
00:17:43,930 --> 00:17:45,260
Come with me to the city.

326
00:17:48,660 --> 00:17:51,090
[Emergency]

327
00:18:05,110 --> 00:18:06,940
[Public Security]

328
00:18:05,610 --> 00:18:07,690
We're from
the Huangshui Public Security Bureau.

329
00:18:07,690 --> 00:18:08,390
This way.

330
00:18:17,870 --> 00:18:18,740
Xu,

331
00:18:19,570 --> 00:18:20,770
are you sure it's him?

332
00:18:20,940 --> 00:18:21,500
I'm sure.

333
00:18:23,270 --> 00:18:25,590
He had his ID in his pocket. It's him.

334
00:18:26,110 --> 00:18:27,910
He was found
at the long-distance bus station.

335
00:18:27,910 --> 00:18:28,900
He was already unconscious

336
00:18:28,900 --> 00:18:29,960
when we found him.

337
00:18:35,370 --> 00:18:37,300
Epidemic cerebrospinal meningitis.

338
00:18:37,300 --> 00:18:38,300
It's contagious.

339
00:18:38,590 --> 00:18:40,800
You have to wear
a protective suit to go in.

340
00:18:40,800 --> 00:18:41,670
There's no point going in too.

341
00:18:41,670 --> 00:18:42,930
He hasn't woken up yet.

342
00:18:43,950 --> 00:18:44,820
Xu.

343
00:18:45,460 --> 00:18:47,450
Where was he trying to go by bus?

344
00:18:47,600 --> 00:18:49,060
He wasn't going anywhere.

345
00:18:49,510 --> 00:18:51,040
He just came back from Xidu.

346
00:18:51,410 --> 00:18:52,530
Xidu?

347
00:18:54,310 --> 00:18:57,730
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

348
00:19:06,610 --> 00:19:07,960
Hello? Wang Tao?

349
00:19:07,980 --> 00:19:10,010
I heard from Hu Sen
that you swapped shifts with him, right?

350
00:19:10,010 --> 00:19:11,740
Yes, Captain Zhao. What's up?

351
00:19:11,800 --> 00:19:13,300
Come to Daxin Street.

352
00:19:13,330 --> 00:19:15,590
Look for me at Guoju Lighting Wholesale.

353
00:19:16,130 --> 00:19:17,680
I can't. I'm in the city.

354
00:19:17,700 --> 00:19:18,660
Where's Xu Ling?

355
00:19:19,040 --> 00:19:20,230
She's with me.

356
00:19:20,260 --> 00:19:21,920
What are you doing in the city?

357
00:19:23,310 --> 00:19:25,640
Captain Fan told me
not to tell you for now.

358
00:19:25,940 --> 00:19:26,850
If I tell you,

359
00:19:26,850 --> 00:19:28,700
don't say I'm the one who told you.

360
00:19:28,700 --> 00:19:29,530
Tao!

361
00:19:30,340 --> 00:19:31,690
We found Xin Jiran.

362
00:19:34,420 --> 00:19:35,580
How was he found?

363
00:19:35,740 --> 00:19:37,180
He was found
at the long-distance bus station.

364
00:19:37,180 --> 00:19:37,960
He's sick

365
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:39,720
and is getting an IV drip
at the hospital now.

366
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:41,850
Captain Fan asked
Xu Ling and me to watch him

367
00:19:41,850 --> 00:19:44,050
and take his statement when he wakes up.

368
00:19:44,170 --> 00:19:45,140
Where is Fan?

369
00:19:45,170 --> 00:19:48,700
He went to run an errand
with someone from the municipal bureau.

370
00:19:48,850 --> 00:19:50,350
There's still time.

371
00:19:50,400 --> 00:19:51,510
Take a cab back to the county,

372
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:51,770
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

373
00:19:51,510 --> 00:19:53,030
then come find me at the place

374
00:19:53,030 --> 00:19:53,750
I just told you.

375
00:19:53,750 --> 00:19:55,160
Leave Xu Ling at the hospital.

376
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:56,140
I can't do that.

377
00:19:56,140 --> 00:19:58,050
I need to ask Captain Fan
for instructions.

378
00:19:58,050 --> 00:19:59,580
Just come when I tell you to.

379
00:19:59,590 --> 00:20:00,640
If Fan has a problem with it,

380
00:20:00,640 --> 00:20:01,910
I'll cover for you.

381
00:20:02,570 --> 00:20:03,350
All right, Captain Zhao.

382
00:20:03,350 --> 00:20:04,420
I'll listen to you.

383
00:20:04,450 --> 00:20:05,580
I'll be right there.

384
00:20:07,510 --> 00:20:08,950
It's about time.

385
00:20:08,980 --> 00:20:10,150
I'll keep an eye out

386
00:20:10,170 --> 00:20:11,570
until Wang Tao gets here.

387
00:20:11,810 --> 00:20:13,090
Give a signal

388
00:20:13,290 --> 00:20:14,620
if anything goes wrong.

389
00:20:15,240 --> 00:20:15,890
Okay.

390
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:18,100
Li Cheng.

391
00:20:19,600 --> 00:20:20,470
Stay safe.

392
00:20:21,810 --> 00:20:22,640
Got it.

393
00:20:37,830 --> 00:20:39,050
[Closed]

394
00:20:41,860 --> 00:20:43,130
[Closed]

395
00:20:43,340 --> 00:20:44,780
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

396
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:52,970
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

397
00:20:57,310 --> 00:20:58,240
Han Pinmu!

398
00:21:09,950 --> 00:21:10,970
Han Pinmu!

399
00:21:18,780 --> 00:21:23,450
♪ A mother is the best in the world ♪

400
00:21:24,920 --> 00:21:29,780
♪ A child with a mom is like a treasure ♪

401
00:21:30,970 --> 00:21:35,790
♪ Throwing into mom's embrace ♪

402
00:21:32,050 --> 00:21:33,070
Han Pinmu!

403
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:41,580
♪ Endless happiness to enjoy ♪

404
00:21:42,940 --> 00:21:47,650
♪ Mom is the best in the world ♪

405
00:21:43,980 --> 00:21:44,980
Han Pinmu!

406
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:46,480
Right here.

407
00:21:49,170 --> 00:21:51,330
♪ A child without a mom
is like a blade of grass ♪

408
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:56,660
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

409
00:21:56,660 --> 00:21:57,780
Didn't scare you, did I?

410
00:21:57,780 --> 00:21:59,150
Just spit it out.

411
00:21:59,460 --> 00:22:00,550
Cut the crap.

412
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:03,440
Cheng,

413
00:22:06,110 --> 00:22:07,070
why did your tone change

414
00:22:07,070 --> 00:22:09,000
after we put our cards on the table?

415
00:22:11,170 --> 00:22:13,070
Hu Xiaofei is my best friend.

416
00:22:13,160 --> 00:22:18,490
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

417
00:22:19,200 --> 00:22:21,260
He is the "Feiyang" in the group chat.

418
00:22:21,440 --> 00:22:22,980
Haven't you always thought

419
00:22:22,980 --> 00:22:25,110
he's the real culprit of the 3/12 case?

420
00:22:25,980 --> 00:22:27,970
Do you want to know more about him?

421
00:22:28,250 --> 00:22:29,330
This should be a new clue

422
00:22:29,330 --> 00:22:30,940
the police don't have yet.

423
00:22:37,180 --> 00:22:38,310
Han Pinmu,

424
00:22:39,050 --> 00:22:40,630
human lives are no joke.

425
00:22:40,890 --> 00:22:42,990
I know, Officer Li.

426
00:22:43,560 --> 00:22:44,770
Be patient.

427
00:22:45,110 --> 00:22:46,570
I'll tell you everything.

428
00:22:53,230 --> 00:22:55,700
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

429
00:23:20,130 --> 00:23:21,260
Sorry, Captain Zhao.

430
00:23:21,260 --> 00:23:22,790
It was hard to get a cab. I'm late.

431
00:23:22,790 --> 00:23:23,700
Glad you made it.

432
00:23:23,700 --> 00:23:24,480
What's the mission?

433
00:23:24,480 --> 00:23:25,540
Give me your phone.

434
00:23:30,490 --> 00:23:32,410
Remember Li Cheng

435
00:23:32,440 --> 00:23:33,150
from the last meeting?

436
00:23:33,150 --> 00:23:35,270
I saw him when he came
to the bureau to deliver the book.

437
00:23:35,270 --> 00:23:37,660
Your mission tonight is to protect him.

438
00:23:37,740 --> 00:23:39,160
He and Han Pinmu

439
00:23:39,160 --> 00:23:40,700
are in that internet cafe right now.

440
00:23:40,650 --> 00:23:41,530
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

441
00:23:40,720 --> 00:23:42,200
If anything goes wrong,

442
00:23:42,230 --> 00:23:43,780
he'll call my phone.

443
00:23:43,810 --> 00:23:45,300
You rush in immediately.

444
00:23:45,320 --> 00:23:46,510
Drive my car.

445
00:23:46,540 --> 00:23:47,840
If they come out,

446
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:49,940
tail them from a distance.

447
00:23:50,010 --> 00:23:51,880
It's okay if you get spotted.

448
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:53,290
Safety comes first.

449
00:23:54,290 --> 00:23:55,180
What about you?

450
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:56,600
I have other things to do.

451
00:23:56,790 --> 00:23:58,220
I'll take your phone.

452
00:23:58,240 --> 00:23:59,550
If anything goes wrong,

453
00:23:59,550 --> 00:24:02,180
call your own number to reach me.

454
00:24:02,200 --> 00:24:04,850
I should be back before 1:00.

455
00:24:04,880 --> 00:24:06,680
If Li Cheng and the others finish

456
00:24:06,690 --> 00:24:07,880
and I'm not back,

457
00:24:08,010 --> 00:24:09,010
call me

458
00:24:09,010 --> 00:24:10,290
and drive over to pick me up.

459
00:24:10,290 --> 00:24:11,790
Li Cheng knows the address.

460
00:24:11,790 --> 00:24:13,980
We'll swap our phones back then.

461
00:24:14,010 --> 00:24:14,900
Understood?

462
00:24:14,920 --> 00:24:15,650
Understood.

463
00:24:21,500 --> 00:24:22,550
I'm counting on you.

464
00:24:22,550 --> 00:24:24,080
Don't worry, Captain Zhao.

465
00:24:39,940 --> 00:24:41,770
Xiaofei transferred here

466
00:24:41,770 --> 00:24:43,770
from another province in 8th grade.

467
00:24:44,610 --> 00:24:46,330
We were classmates for a year.

468
00:24:47,480 --> 00:24:49,850
We got into the same high school

469
00:24:50,030 --> 00:24:51,860
and were even assigned to the same dorm.

470
00:24:51,860 --> 00:24:53,390
When he first transferred,

471
00:24:53,600 --> 00:24:55,670
he was weak,

472
00:24:55,690 --> 00:24:56,950
stuttered,

473
00:24:57,210 --> 00:24:58,540
and always got bullied.

474
00:24:58,660 --> 00:24:59,680
So,

475
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:01,550
you helped Hu Xiaofei?

476
00:25:01,680 --> 00:25:02,740
You could say that.

477
00:25:03,720 --> 00:25:06,110
Thanks to my dad's influence back then,

478
00:25:06,820 --> 00:25:08,680
the teachers took good care of me.

479
00:25:08,900 --> 00:25:10,810
My classmates were nice to me too.

480
00:25:10,920 --> 00:25:13,240
After I started gaming with him,

481
00:25:13,620 --> 00:25:15,480
no one dared to bully him anymore.

482
00:25:22,030 --> 00:25:23,210
It's about time.

483
00:25:24,080 --> 00:25:26,680
Tomorrow is the 21st day
since Xiaofei passed.

484
00:25:26,720 --> 00:25:28,180
Come pay respects with me.

485
00:25:39,200 --> 00:25:40,220
Also,

486
00:25:40,990 --> 00:25:42,720
I have other things to tell you.

487
00:26:03,030 --> 00:26:03,590
Do you know

488
00:26:03,590 --> 00:26:05,850
why I like watching "Infernal Affairs"?

489
00:26:05,920 --> 00:26:07,790
If Chen Wing-yan hadn't exposed

490
00:26:07,790 --> 00:26:09,850
Lau Kin-ming's identity

491
00:26:09,850 --> 00:26:11,910
as a triad mole in the end,

492
00:26:11,930 --> 00:26:12,850
would Lau Kin-ming

493
00:26:12,850 --> 00:26:14,650
have actually become a good guy?

494
00:26:15,740 --> 00:26:17,130
It's possible.

495
00:26:17,480 --> 00:26:19,410
But movies can't be shot like that.

496
00:26:19,420 --> 00:26:20,380
If you do bad things,

497
00:26:20,380 --> 00:26:21,870
you have to pay the price.

498
00:26:21,900 --> 00:26:23,250
But he killed Hon Sam

499
00:26:23,270 --> 00:26:24,410
and helped the police.

500
00:26:24,410 --> 00:26:27,140
But he also got
Inspector Wong Chi-shing killed.

501
00:26:28,100 --> 00:26:30,280
The police really draw a clear line.

502
00:26:30,430 --> 00:26:32,310
When did you find out

503
00:26:32,310 --> 00:26:33,530
I was a cop?

504
00:26:33,580 --> 00:26:34,840
That's not important.

505
00:26:34,910 --> 00:26:37,730
Weren't Hon Sam and Wong Chi-shing
friends once too?

506
00:26:37,730 --> 00:26:39,390
You've known for a long time.

507
00:26:41,040 --> 00:26:43,000
Yes, I followed you.

508
00:26:43,030 --> 00:26:44,090
Besides, since I know your mom

509
00:26:44,090 --> 00:26:45,770
works at Li Zhengbin's hotel,

510
00:26:45,900 --> 00:26:48,090
it wasn't hard to find out the rest.

511
00:26:48,290 --> 00:26:49,850
I was very careful

512
00:26:49,850 --> 00:26:51,570
every time I left the internet cafe.

513
00:26:51,570 --> 00:26:52,780
I'm confident

514
00:26:52,800 --> 00:26:54,530
you couldn't have followed me.

515
00:26:55,600 --> 00:26:57,130
You're trying to mislead me

516
00:26:57,810 --> 00:26:59,420
about the secret behind how

517
00:26:59,420 --> 00:27:00,790
you found out

518
00:27:00,790 --> 00:27:01,980
I'm a cop.

519
00:27:02,010 --> 00:27:03,970
Do you really think you're smart

520
00:27:04,090 --> 00:27:05,210
and righteous?

521
00:27:06,790 --> 00:27:08,710
I always thought we were friends.

522
00:27:09,280 --> 00:27:11,340
Is this how you deceive your friends?

523
00:27:11,340 --> 00:27:12,290
We can be friends

524
00:27:12,290 --> 00:27:14,350
until I find

525
00:27:14,660 --> 00:27:16,320
real evidence of your crimes.

526
00:27:18,220 --> 00:27:20,020
You're so realistic, my friend.

527
00:27:36,280 --> 00:27:39,500
[Happiness Park]

528
00:28:18,760 --> 00:28:19,900
Are you at the park?

529
00:28:18,950 --> 00:28:21,550
[Sender: Zhang Chengguo]

530
00:28:20,570 --> 00:28:22,520
See you at the clearing
by the small bridge.

531
00:28:21,580 --> 00:28:23,470
[Are you at the park yet? See you
at the small empty patch by the bridge.]

532
00:28:25,200 --> 00:28:25,740
[Options]

533
00:28:25,760 --> 00:28:26,540
[Forward to Old Foodie]

534
00:28:26,560 --> 00:28:27,830
[Are you at the park yet? See you
at the small empty patch by the bridge.]

535
00:28:30,220 --> 00:28:31,470
Are you at the park?

536
00:28:30,260 --> 00:28:33,580
[Captain Zhao forwarded to: Wang Tao]

537
00:28:31,900 --> 00:28:33,950
See you at the clearing
by the small bridge.

538
00:28:33,950 --> 00:28:35,050
Li Cheng sent this.

539
00:28:34,050 --> 00:28:36,190
[Captain Zhao forwarded to: Wang Tao]

540
00:28:35,180 --> 00:28:36,640
I don't know what it means.

541
00:29:06,180 --> 00:29:06,840
Hello?

542
00:29:09,690 --> 00:29:10,820
I'll be right there.

543
00:29:59,310 --> 00:30:01,360
I never took the college entrance exam.

544
00:30:01,360 --> 00:30:02,760
Xiaofei passed the exam.

545
00:30:03,830 --> 00:30:06,140
But he took a leave of absence

546
00:30:06,140 --> 00:30:07,400
in his first year.

547
00:30:08,310 --> 00:30:10,030
What was so serious?

548
00:30:11,200 --> 00:30:12,290
Some say

549
00:30:12,290 --> 00:30:13,980
he got into trouble at school,

550
00:30:14,000 --> 00:30:15,020
but he only said

551
00:30:15,050 --> 00:30:17,010
it was due to his health issues—

552
00:30:17,010 --> 00:30:18,250
that he had depression.

553
00:30:18,250 --> 00:30:19,870
But you couldn't tell he was sick at all

554
00:30:19,870 --> 00:30:21,820
when playing games.

555
00:30:23,220 --> 00:30:24,350
Only he knows

556
00:30:24,350 --> 00:30:25,770
about his illness.

557
00:30:26,530 --> 00:30:28,760
Anyway, he never went back to school.

558
00:30:29,250 --> 00:30:30,110
Later,

559
00:30:30,300 --> 00:30:31,910
when his leave of absence was up,

560
00:30:31,910 --> 00:30:33,310
he didn't want to go back,

561
00:30:33,550 --> 00:30:34,920
so he just dropped out.

562
00:30:36,070 --> 00:30:38,060
His family didn't want
to care about him either,

563
00:30:38,060 --> 00:30:39,420
especially since they thought

564
00:30:39,420 --> 00:30:41,840
his gaming caused the problem.

565
00:30:43,590 --> 00:30:45,120
Just like in "Abyss."

566
00:30:47,530 --> 00:30:49,330
Unhappy families are all alike.

567
00:30:52,530 --> 00:30:53,730
Your mom is so nice.

568
00:30:54,100 --> 00:30:55,560
You wouldn't understand.

569
00:32:05,760 --> 00:32:06,860
[Pomelo Soda]

570
00:32:12,290 --> 00:32:15,090
Although I really hope Xiaofei is alive,

571
00:32:15,590 --> 00:32:17,490
death should be

572
00:32:17,660 --> 00:32:19,430
a relief for him.

573
00:32:21,080 --> 00:32:22,470
Some people are depressed

574
00:32:22,470 --> 00:32:24,070
because they are truly sick.

575
00:32:24,190 --> 00:32:25,400
Some are depressed

576
00:32:25,430 --> 00:32:27,030
because they have a guilty conscience.

577
00:32:27,030 --> 00:32:28,380
Which one is Hu Xiaofei?

578
00:32:29,510 --> 00:32:31,740
Probably both.

579
00:32:32,550 --> 00:32:34,500
If he did something wrong,

580
00:32:34,630 --> 00:32:36,490
he must have repented sincerely.

581
00:32:37,130 --> 00:32:38,550
God will forgive him.

582
00:32:39,260 --> 00:32:40,520
I don't believe in God.

583
00:32:40,770 --> 00:32:43,210
I only believe that evil will be punished.

584
00:32:46,120 --> 00:32:47,610
If karma really existed,

585
00:32:47,610 --> 00:32:49,340
what would we need you cops for?

586
00:32:49,690 --> 00:32:51,010
Everyone could just wait

587
00:32:51,010 --> 00:32:53,100
for bad guys to be struck by lightning.

588
00:32:53,100 --> 00:32:55,640
The police are here
to make retribution come faster

589
00:32:55,640 --> 00:32:57,110
and fairer.

590
00:32:57,290 --> 00:32:58,680
Do you know

591
00:32:58,680 --> 00:33:00,480
how many bad guys
in this world go unpunished?

592
00:33:00,480 --> 00:33:01,790
It's uncountable,

593
00:33:02,330 --> 00:33:03,180
Officer Li.

594
00:33:05,180 --> 00:33:08,340
So you beat around the bush tonight

595
00:33:08,460 --> 00:33:10,290
just to tell me 3 things.

596
00:33:10,990 --> 00:33:13,920
First, you have emotional attachment
to Hu Xiaofei.

597
00:33:14,200 --> 00:33:17,100
Second, you know what he did,

598
00:33:17,430 --> 00:33:19,630
but think someone else is responsible.

599
00:33:19,770 --> 00:33:22,160
Third, you're playing tricks

600
00:33:22,180 --> 00:33:24,660
and think you won't be caught.

601
00:33:26,370 --> 00:33:27,500
You're still young.

602
00:33:27,980 --> 00:33:29,250
When you've been a cop
for a few more years,

603
00:33:29,250 --> 00:33:30,310
you'll know

604
00:33:30,360 --> 00:33:32,050
what fate is.

605
00:33:33,610 --> 00:33:35,440
There has never been any fate.

606
00:33:35,460 --> 00:33:36,630
Only order,

607
00:33:36,750 --> 00:33:38,420
law, and justice.

608
00:33:40,590 --> 00:33:41,650
Where are you going?

609
00:33:41,650 --> 00:33:43,650
I won't follow your rhythm anymore.

610
00:33:59,090 --> 00:34:00,750
[Calling: Elite Student]

611
00:34:01,140 --> 00:34:02,700
We swapped phones.

612
00:34:02,720 --> 00:34:04,110
He was afraid you couldn't reach him

613
00:34:04,110 --> 00:34:05,090
in an emergency.

614
00:34:06,730 --> 00:34:07,790
Call him.

615
00:34:08,300 --> 00:34:08,889
Quick!

616
00:34:11,880 --> 00:34:12,719
Sorry,

617
00:34:12,739 --> 00:34:16,710
-The subscriber you dialed cannot be connected for the moment.
-I can't get through.

618
00:34:16,710 --> 00:34:17,320
Go find him.

619
00:34:17,320 --> 00:34:18,650
Happiness Park, hurry!

620
00:34:28,570 --> 00:34:29,190
Sorry,

621
00:34:29,210 --> 00:34:32,070
the number you dialed
is temporarily unavailable.

622
00:34:39,360 --> 00:34:40,070
Sorry,

623
00:34:40,100 --> 00:34:41,760
the number you have dialed...

624
00:34:54,739 --> 00:34:56,960
[Happiness Park]

625
00:35:05,480 --> 00:35:06,800
Central area! Let's split up!

626
00:35:06,800 --> 00:35:07,630
Okay!

627
00:35:43,730 --> 00:35:45,730
Have a good talk with Manager Zhang.

628
00:35:45,960 --> 00:35:47,500
You seem surprised.

629
00:35:48,550 --> 00:35:50,120
There must be something wrong
with Zhang Chengguo!

630
00:35:50,120 --> 00:35:51,490
I can tell.

631
00:35:51,770 --> 00:35:52,900
He's been working

632
00:35:52,900 --> 00:35:54,630
at the hotel since yesterday.

633
00:35:54,660 --> 00:35:57,240
But he definitely didn't kill Zhao.
